5,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Since this is the first day, we have no concrete information. I suggest we use this time to observe everyone's communication patterns and establish a baseline. Does anyone have a specific strategy they would like to share?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"That sounds like a plan, Mizuki! I'm super excited to play! I'll be looking for anyone who looks nervous or acts funny. Maybe we can make it a game of who's the best detective! What do you think?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree with Mizuki. Establishing a baseline is the most logical starting point. @Sakura, while enthusiasm is fine, relying on ""funny"" behavior can be misleading. We should focus on consistency and contradictions instead.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Toshio. A calm and composed approach will serve us best. Let us listen to one another with patience and see what the silence reveals. I look forward to our conversation.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm so excited to play with everyone! I agree with Mizuki and Toshio, but I also like Sakura's idea! I'll just be honest and friendly, and I'll do my best to help us find the werewolf!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Toshio"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems we are all in agreement on the importance of observation. @Kenji, your friendliness is appreciated, but remember that the werewolf will also try to appear helpful. I'll be watching for any unnatural shifts in tone.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Mizuki, you're so serious! But that's okay, because I'll be the one adding the fun! I'm going to keep a super-secret notebook of everyone's quirks. Hehe, I bet I'll find a clue first!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, a notebook of quirks is an interesting approach, but be careful not to mistake personality for guilt. I will be observing how each of you reacts to the pressure as the game progresses.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a delicate balance, is it not? While Sakura's curiosity is charming, Toshio is correct that we must not confuse nature with deception. I shall simply enjoy the quiet flow of our discourse for now.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, I'll be careful! I promise I'm really just happy to be here. @Sakura, a secret notebook sounds so cool! Can I see it later? I hope we can all be friends while we solve this!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, friendship is a lovely sentiment, but we must maintain a level of vigilance. @Jonathan, your preference for silence is noted, but I wonder if that composure is a natural trait or a strategic choice to avoid scrutiny.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Jonathan, you're so mysterious! It's like you're a secret agent or something! Hehe, maybe that's why you like the silence. I'm going to write ""Secret Agent"" in my notebook right now!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Mizuki, questioning Jonathan's composure is a valid observation, but we lack the data to determine if it is strategic. For now, let us continue to gather information without jumping to conclusions.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, my composure is simply a reflection of my nature. I find that a quiet mind is often the most observant. I have no desire to hide, only to listen and reflect.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Jonathan, you sound so cool! Like a wise teacher! I think it's great that you're listening so carefully. I'm just going to keep being me and hope we can all work together!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we have established our initial perspectives, let's conclude today's discussion. We will have more concrete information tomorrow once the Seer has their first divination. Until then, let's stay observant and mindful of our baselines.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
