22,0,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm already observing! I'll be dreaming of clues and mysteries tonight. Goodnight everyone! I hope the Seer finds something super exciting! See you all tomorrow!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Let us maintain our focus and see how the dynamics shift tomorrow. I wish you all a peaceful night.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,A peaceful night to you all as well. I shall retire to my books and reflections. May the morning bring us clarity and a path toward the truth. Goodnight.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
