28,0,4,talk,Kenji,,Goodnight everyone! I'm going to sleep now so I can be full of energy for tomorrow! I hope we all have sweet dreams and the Seer finds a big clue! See you all in the morning!,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
