69,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Oh no! Jonathan is gone! That's so sad, he was like a real-life secret agent! And Mizuki got attacked too? This is getting really scary! Is everyone okay? Who could be so mean to do that?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, please stay calm. The loss of Jonathan and the attack on Mizuki are critical data points. The werewolf is playing aggressively. Since Mizuki survived, we must prioritize her information and any new leads.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Wait, Mizuki survived?! That's a relief! But it's so scary that someone was attacked. I can't believe Jonathan is gone too... he was so nice! @Toshio, you're right, we have to be careful. Does anyone know who did it?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Toshio, you're always so calm! But how can we know who did it? Maybe the werewolf is just hiding in plain sight, pretending to be a goody-two-shoes! @Mizuki, are you okay? Did you see anything scary last night?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, the werewolf's identity is hidden by the nature of the game, not by their behavior. @Mizuki, as the target of the attack, your survival is fortunate. Do you have any observations or suspicions based on the current state of the game?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, I'm really worried about you too! It's so mean that the werewolf is attacking us. @Mizuki, please tell us if you're okay! Do you think the werewolf attacked you because you're the Seer? That would be so scary!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Kenji, that's a great point! If Mizuki is the Seer, the werewolf must be super scared of her! @Mizuki, if you are the Seer, please tell us what you found! We need a big clue to catch the meanie!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, @Kenji, let us not assume Mizuki is the Seer simply because she was attacked. The werewolf may have targeted her to remove a logical voice from the group. @Mizuki, if you are the Seer, the risk of silence now outweighs the risk of exposure.","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Kenji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, that makes sense too! I didn't think about that. But if Mizuki is the Seer, she's the only one who can really help us now! Please, @Mizuki, if you know who the werewolf is, tell us so we can stop them!","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Mizuki, please don't be scared! We're all here for you! If you have a secret clue in your head, now is the best time to share it so we can save everyone! I'm ready to help you catch the wolf!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"Since we are down to four players, the window for secrecy is closing. If the Seer is still among us, revealing a result now is the only way to ensure we don't execute another innocent. @Mizuki, the village is waiting.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"I agree with @Toshio! We're getting so few of us now, it's really scary. @Mizuki, please tell us if you have a clue! I really want us to find the werewolf together so we can all be safe!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
